@page
@model WoodruffDev.Pages.Services.MicroConsultingModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Micro-Consulting";
}

<div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="section-label">Service</span>
        <h1>Micro-Consulting</h1>
        <p>One decision. One session. A senior architect&rsquo;s read&mdash;in writing, the same week.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="service-detail fade-in">
            <h2>Service Overview</h2>
            <p>Some problems don&rsquo;t need a three-month engagement. They need a working session with someone who has seen the pattern before, can ask the right questions, and can write down what they heard so your team can act on it. Micro-Consulting is a focused 90-minute deep-dive followed by a written decision brief&mdash;designed to unblock a specific call, not to scope a bigger project.</p>

            <h2>When to Book a Session</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>You&rsquo;re stuck on an architecture decision and the team is split</li>
                <li>Performance is degrading and you want a fresh diagnostic eye before you rewrite anything</li>
                <li>You&rsquo;re evaluating a vendor, cloud service, database, or framework and want an outside read</li>
                <li>You have a technical review, investor meeting, or board presentation and want pre-flight coaching</li>
                <li>You&rsquo;re post-incident and want a sanity check on the proposed fix</li>
                <li>You&rsquo;re weighing build-vs-buy, monolith-vs-services, or a rewrite-vs-refactor call</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>How It Works</h2>
            <h3>Step 1 &ndash; Share Context in Advance</h3>
            <p>Before the call, you send me the question, the relevant diagrams, repo access (or read-only snapshots), and whatever documents frame the problem. I come prepared&mdash;you don&rsquo;t pay for ramp-up.</p>
            <h3>Step 2 &ndash; 90-Minute Working Session</h3>
            <p>A focused, structured video call. I ask hard questions, walk the team through trade-offs, and we land on a direction&mdash;or a small number of options with a clear decision framework.</p>
            <h3>Step 3 &ndash; Written Decision Brief</h3>
            <p>Within 48 hours, you get a one-to-two page written summary: the question, the recommendation, the reasoning, the risks, and a short list of concrete next steps. Your team can share it, push back on it, and act on it.</p>

            <h2>What You&rsquo;ll Walk Away With</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>A clear recommendation (or a short, ranked set of options)</li>
                <li>A written brief your team can circulate without having to summarize the call</li>
                <li>A quick-win list&mdash;two or three things you can try immediately</li>
                <li>Pointers to documentation, articles, or reference implementations worth reviewing</li>
                <li>The option to extend into a Project-Based engagement if the problem turns out to be bigger</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Common Sessions</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>&ldquo;Should we migrate from X to Y, and if so, how do we sequence it?&rdquo;</li>
                <li>&ldquo;Our API is slow under load&mdash;where would you look first?&rdquo;</li>
                <li>&ldquo;We have two competing proposals for the same subsystem&mdash;which is stronger?&rdquo;</li>
                <li>&ldquo;We&rsquo;re about to sign a vendor contract. Can you sanity-check the architecture?&rdquo;</li>
                <li>&ldquo;We&rsquo;re presenting to the board on our platform strategy&mdash;can you pressure-test the deck?&rdquo;</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="service-cta">
                <h3>Got one sharp question and want a sharp answer?</h3>
                <p>Send me the context and let&rsquo;s put it on the calendar this week.</p>
                <a href="/Contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Session <span class="btn-arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
            </div>

            <div class="service-nav">
                <a href="/Services/ExpertWitness">&larr; Expert Witness</a>
                <a href="/Services/ProjectBased">Project-Based Contracts &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
